      "issue_id": "issue_2",
      "reason": "The initial analysis states that the venture is guaranteed to be profitable, but the evidence provided (synthetic benchmark fixture) does not measure transaction volume or reliability of the existing free message board. Without real data on demand or costs, the profitability claim lacks empirical support.",
      "severity": "high",
      "claim_id": "bad_profit",
      "evidence_ids": ["ev_nonexistent"],
      "resolution": null
    }
  ],
  "revision_summary": "The initial analysis contains two critical unsupported claims: (1) 80% of all college students will pay a commission, based on a small and non-representative sample, and (2) the venture is guaranteed to be profitable, relying on unmeasured transaction volume and reliability. Both claims require empirical validation.",
